Wait a second - does this really work?  If so it's a really great
spoiler. It sounds possible - some bug where the Wiz hides until
he recovers hit points, but doesn't ever recover any when he's on a 
different level from you.  I wonder if quaffing a cursed potion of
gain level while he's healing on the upstairs would have the same
effect.  Or (even sneakier) if you let him go recover on the upstairs
of Vlad's tower, and then take the down stairs out, leaving him there
forever.

Somehow,  I can't imagine that the dev team forgot about this.  Even
the "throwing a potion of paralysis at him and running" trick doesn't
work in 3.1.3.  I'll bet this doesn't get rid of him forever either.
In my quick trial in wizard mode, I couldn't get him to pick up the
wand of digging.  Can anyone expand on this?

